sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant N as Neon Auth
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant D as Application DB
  C->>N: Sign in through supported flow
  N-->>C: Session cookie
  C->>N: authClient.token()
  N-->>C: Short-lived Bearer JWT
  C->>A: Authorization Bearer JWT
  A->>N: Fetch branch JWKS on cache miss or key rotation
  N-->>A: Public verification keys
  Note over A: Check EdDSA signature, issuer, audience, expiry, subject
  A->>D: Resolve UserProfile and query user-scoped data
  D-->>A: Authorized records
  A-->>C: Validated response
